<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Zivno mutual fund 9mo gross jumps.</title>
<headline>Czech Zivno mutual fund 9mo gross jumps.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine months ending September 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		97.4	  vs	 20.5</p>
<p> Operating result	  12.0 loss   vs	  6.6 loss</p>
<p> Total assets	   1,287.5	  vs	892.0</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Zivnobanka Podilovy Fond. The firm is a closed-end mutual fund run by bank Zivnostenska Banka a.s.. Its shares are listed on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
